        {
          "id": "d10-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q1 2026, management expects modest sequential growth with flat headcount. Capital expenditure for Q1 2026 is budgeted at $4.1M, the majority allocated to laboratory equipment.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
          },
          "width": 166
